<description>&lt;p&gt;The Sudanese army has taken Bakori and Sali and pushed back attacks in the Blue Nile while advancing in West Kordofan, as the Rapid Support Forces continue drone strikes that have killed civilians in Blue Nile and White Nile states and caused a two-week power blackout that raised prices. A senior RSF commander defected to the army after 13 years, and Pakistan signed a 1.5 billion-dollar security cooperation deal with Sudan. Drones now account for two thirds of child casualties in the conflict. 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxOQmNuUC01MzVjeTBMQjlLZjRORUdLTThVcERuZGxyRFRiQXp1LVhScEVRaVpXVUM2UWM1NC1nN0ZmazJSc2h4Mmc5ZjRldS04MXg4RS1WTER0cnN2QURZb19JWE9LYzcwYXZ6UlMxWmh0U19IR0owN1Q5Tm00TEI3ZG51Z19UZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE9uaDkyQ3k5RURDdWRTQ25OeW5CdTByclJpck5USTl0czFROFhkT3h5NTh4VW84VEs1cHJUamxVaEdlZEhxNFlzVnpsMXJZRS1nd21GclhlQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxQV1dFT1YwMFRzN0hoMHVfQ2tTakU1bnc2ZEFSdGV4WWIyN283dEZoLXVVTVNCMm1CaXg1bFZkSngtYy1IS2xBRkJjT0ZtN2hHLWI0Tm5CTmp6YkhGd1ZqOGhpZnh5S2tvNlR4TWpBMlpxamM4QWw3bXV5cnljb2ItUUJlMk4?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxOQ3NGMmJlR0lfSEJmbmktSDdwQzI3VV9KZmpBbWZ6c3g4WTRlNHY5NElSUmw3TzdtWExLNTNMUVF4am5fMmhtdDVRbTNaZFRaOGN5dkJGbDdSaF9UM0F6dnVNendaZUg5S0NjWGF1SlltRGZBM1JIcXJlY1NhcmNnRWFyMVo0Ry1vWWU0V3FOQW9BOUpFem5ZZmtWUFVrdlU2UWFYdEplSFIzLUpPZWs4UEJGRzJ4dW_SAbwBQVVfeXFMUDVkMjJOMFQ0cVNZc3RaTHFnOFRuT1BhSzg0elhTdWRGelVCczNHOTU3RGNnLVBBS3Q0MDFtM2EzR0g3R2JIVkRFWnAwQTVIRVlzMWplQ2ozNGNrLXVDRnh3SGJ0dTh4UnJ3aU9sYkw3QVVWN0ZpSkVYV2pKRjI3NVg5ZnNyWExZTXFWUl9yMXlwMFNnR2ttV2lSWm5FbjJxN